abstract: >-
  Anonymous unrefereed candidate package proving exact computer-assisted
  Recht–Ré inequalities through five factors, balanced six-factor families,
  and a one-epoch bias-mean-square reversal. The bundle includes exact
  certificate replay, semantic reconstruction checks, and mutation controls;
  it is not external peer review or formal verification.
